      <div class="notif"><span class="ic" style="background:#eef6f2;color:#124d3b"><svg><use href="#i-book"/></svg></span><div><b>Library book due Friday</b><small>"Things Fall Apart"</small></div><time>Mon</time></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= MODULES ================= -->
<section id="modules">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Modules</span>
      <h2>Everything else<br>the school runs.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Beyond marks and registers, the same accounts and the same records cover the rest of school life.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mod-grid">
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#report-cards"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-file"/></svg></div><h3>Report cards</h3><p>Bilingual bulletins with ranks, averages and council remarks, for one student or a whole class.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#finance"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-wallet"/></svg></div><h3>Finance</h3><p>Charge a class or a student, record payments, print receipts and see who still owes.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#attendance"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></div><h3>Attendance &amp; discipline</h3><p>Registers, justifications and term totals, with a discipline master for each group of classes.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#timetables"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-cal"/></svg></div><h3>Timetables</h3><p>Generate a full timetable for every class and teacher, then adjust it.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#library"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-book"/></svg></div><h3>Library</h3><p>Catalogue, loans and due dates, visible to students and their parents.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#laboratory"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-flask"/></svg></div><h3>Laboratory</h3><p>Teachers request equipment ahead of practicals; the lab prepares and tracks it.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#statistics"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-chart"/></svg></div><h3>Statistics</h3><p>Pass rates by class, subject and gender for council meetings and inspections.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#access"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></div><h3>Roles &amp; access</h3><p>Everyone sees only what their role allows. Marks lock once a term is published.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
      <a class="mod" href="/modules#promotion"><div class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-users"/></svg></div><h3>Promotion</h3><p>Move students to the next class at year end from their annual averages.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="mods-more"><a href="/modules" class="btn btn-dark">Explore all modules <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div>
  </div>
</section>

